ask(1872,'rviz-goal','RViz feedback panel: ETA14s, distance remaining3.01m, time taken9s','The panel shows 3.01 m remaining and an ETA of 14 s. If interpreted as a constant-speed remaining-path estimate with no stops, what speed is implied?', [('0.215 m/s','Divide the remaining 3.01 m by the remaining 14 s.'),('Approximately 0.334 m/s','This divides remaining distance by the 9 s already elapsed, mixing different intervals.'),('Approximately 4.651 m/s','This reverses the ratio; 14/3.01 has units s/m, not m/s.')],kind='numerical',ck='figure',ass=['Conditional derived estimate from the historical screenshot, not measured velocity or actual future arrival; use the displayed rounded values.'],steps=['Use remaining distance and remaining time from the same estimate.','Compute 3.01/14=0.215 m/s.','The displayed 9 s is elapsed time, not the denominator for this remaining-path estimate.'],formulas=[ETA])
